src/staking/PendlePT.sol:_initiateWithdraw:148|class=C22|High|Any unprivileged holder of an expired PendlePT vault calls initiateWithdraw, which redeems PT into TOKEN_OUT_SY and registers the resulting Ethena sUSDe (or EtherFi weETH) amount as yieldTokenAmount against PT-denominated sharesAmount with no conversion through the issuer's live rate, so the PT-denominated yield-token balance backing the unchanged share supply silently drops by the sUSDe/USDe premium and the shortfall is socialised onto every other depositor.|src/staking/PendlePT.sol
